        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "For students near San Francisco’s 2.0 eighth-grade-GPA cutoff, taking ethnic studies increased ninth-grade GPA by 1.4 grade points.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "The authors derive this local IV estimate from a 0.387 reduced-form GPA discontinuity (robust SE 0.132; N=1,404) and the 0.273 take-up jump. It is a cutoff-local pilot result, not a district-wide average or a result for every implementation.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
